# Extension

- Shadow DOM Fly; host page remains usable.
- Overlay: `pointer-events: none` (non-interactive).
- Optional per-broker host permissions; never `<all_urls>`.
- No credential / cookie / Authorization access.
- No live click / form submit / trading shortcut automation.
- Revalidate stale DOM targets before using them.
- Handle SPA history navigation.
- Production broker failures fail closed (no mock market data).
- Paper is default; Live Assist never auto-submits.
